  "question": {
    "text": "Three numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math> are in geometric progression. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>c</mi></math> are in arithmetic progression and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
